class=\"OPEN\">⌊</mo><mi>x</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch3/ordered-field-of-rationals.html"}